---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { projects, href } from "../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Projects | Rintu Chowdory"
  description="The FastAPI microservice, its CI pipeline and this Astro site, with links to the live deployments and sources."
>
  <header class="max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Projects</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400">
      Two repositories that belong together: an API that is tested, containerised and deployed,
      and the site you are reading that reports on it.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
    {projects.map((project) => (
      <article class="glass-panel card-lift flex flex-col p-5 sm:p-6">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
          <div>
            <h2 class="mono text-base font-semibold text-white">{project.name}</h2>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-300">{project.role}</p>
          </div>
          {project.badge && (
            <a href={project.badge.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label={project.badge.label}>
              <img src={project.badge.src} alt={project.badge.label} class="h-5 opacity-90" loading="lazy" />
            </a>
          )}
        </div>

        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">{project.description}</p>

        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {project.stack.map((tech) => (
            <span class="badge badge-sm badge-outline border-white/20 text-slate-300">{tech}</span>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-6">
          <a class="btn btn-sm border-0 bg-white text-[#05080f] hover:bg-slate-200" href={project.live} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            {project.liveLabel}
          </a>
          {project.extra && (
            <a
              class="btn btn-sm btn-outline border-white/25 text-white hover:bg-white/10"
              href={project.extra.href.startsWith("http") ? project.extra.href : href(project.extra.href)}
              target={project.extra.href.startsWith("http") ? "_blank" : undefined}
              rel="noreferrer"
            >
              {project.extra.label}
            </a>
          )}
          <a class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost text-slate-300" href={project.repo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            Source
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <section class="glass-panel mt-8 p-5 sm:p-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">How the two fit together</h2>
    <ol class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
      <li><span class="mono text-slate-200">1.</span> A push to the API repo runs lint and pytest on three Python versions, builds the image, boots it and polls <span class="mono text-slate-200">/health</span>.</li>
      <li><span class="mono text-slate-200">2.</span> The image goes to GHCR with a semver, branch and <span class="mono text-slate-200">sha-</span> tag plus provenance and an SBOM.</li>
      <li><span class="mono text-slate-200">3.</span> This site fetches the API at build time, then keeps polling in the browser for the live numbers.</li>
      <li><span class="mono text-slate-200">4.</span> A push here lints nothing it cannot verify: the Pages workflow fails if the build output has no <span class="mono text-slate-200">index.html</span>.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
